2026-10-31T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2427) 'frontier learning picks the garment handover timing runs
 # uuid: fe81977e-8df5-5cf8-bdd0-fc9c15df6f3c
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:flight-level:l1
 RFD:Discussion  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-10-31T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2427) 'how the garment handover timing runs are chosen as levels, with a planted defect each.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2427) 'Each timing level runs clean and with its defect planted, so a pass means something.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2427) 'A level that finds its planted defect only some of the time has a result that is luck.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2427) 'Check a new timing level against the rule. Run it on the rung as it is, then on the rung with that level's defect planted.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2427) 'frontier learning picks the garment handover timing runs
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2427) '- The timing runs are levels in RFD66606-2309's sense, scheduled the way RFD66606-2323 schedules the store's attacks.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2427) '- Each level runs on the rung as it is and on the rung with that level's defect planted.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2427) '- A clean run on the real rung counts only after its level found the planted defect in each of its last eight runs.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2427) '- A finding on the real rung is never averaged into a rate: it stops the lane and becomes a level that runs every time.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2427) '- The percentiles the pass limits come from are read only from calibrated levels, so a limit is never set from a load that could not see a slow leg.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2427) '- RFD66606-2287, where this rule lived before the split.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2427) '- RFD66606-2309, the sense of a level. RFD66606-2323, how the store's attacks are scheduled.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2427) 'Levels and problems
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2427) 'A level is a load template with fixed attributes: players, the recorded replay, the zone's distance from the store, the commit group size, and the injected round trip and loss. A problem is one 5 minute run with a drawn seed and replay offset.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2427) 'The planted defects
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2427) '| Level | Planted defect | Found when |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2427) '| --- | --- | --- |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2427) '| store commit leg | a delay added to each commit | that leg's 95th percentile moves |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2427) '| confirm order | confirm sent before the commit | a garment seen before its commit |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2427) '| tick isolation | the tick waits on the store | a tick over its budget |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2427) '| paused players | a short idle timeout | a reconnect during a pause |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2427) '| replay limit | the replay host throttled | the replay named as the limit |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2427) 'Success, regret and mutation
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2427) 'On the planted target, success is the defect found. Regret `1[s ≥ 1] − s/n` over the last eight runs is high when the level finds its defect only some of the time, so its result is luck. Mutation moves one attribute, kept only when the planted find rate rises.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2427  1 LINE
 Text:Written

